clauses.text:
Structure of DLG arrangements
i. DLG arrangements shall be backed by an explicit and legally enforceable contract between the RE and the DLG provider. Such contract, among other things, shall contain the following details:
Extent of DLG cover;
Form in which DLG cover is to be maintained with the RE;
Timeline for DLG invocation;
Disclosure requirements as under para 27 of these Directions.

